{"id":77257349493567,"name":"[V1.3] Fruit Piece Incremental ","desc":"⚔️FRUIT PIECE INCREMENTAL ⚔️\n\nA text-based adventure inspired by one piece!\n\nGain a devil fruit for each major boss you kill!\n\n🏴‍☠️20+ STORY ARCS!\nRomance Dawn to Laugh Tale — battle Crocodile, Doflamingo, Kaido, Blackbeard & more.\n\n⚓JOIN THE GROUP FOR BONUSES!\n\n🍎COUNTLESS DEVIL FRUITS\nRoll across 6 rarities. Rubber, Fire, Thunder, Buddha, Divine Wolf all with unique mechanics and skills\n\n👊MASTER HAKI\nDozens of levels. Specialize in Armament, Observation, or Conqueror's.\n\n🩸BLOODLINES\nMeditate, earn scrolls, unlock power — from Noble Blood to the mythical D. Clan.\n\n🎣FISHING\nCast for rare loot, Devil Fruit Rolls & Ancient-tier catches.\n\n👥RECRUIT BOSSES\nBuild your crew! Recruit powerful bosses to aid you\n\n⭐Favorite so you don't miss updates!\n\nThis game is in alpha, so expect some minor bugs & join the group to report any problems!","path":"/game/77257349493567-fruit-piece-incremental","slug":"77257349493567-fruit-piece-incremental","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a48ca39156e4a524ad34583cae978596f1dd3898d7e09475d912f0549a8ce6b0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e54b8806ed12e1947d244d91b8026b90/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":4933024,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T08:48:32.227Z","creator":{"name":"Contraband 4.0","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"V1.2-One-Piece-Incremental-Auto-Farm-Kind-Of-126870","_id":"69a54ee06e80855051e3356d","title":"Auto Farm Kind Of","game":{"_id":"69a21183ac641ba9c70821e6","gameId":77257349493567,"name":"[V1.3] Fruit Piece Incremental ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":77257349493567},"features":"Consider Joining my discord. Script Requested By @de*ablegooner\nAuto Work\nAuto